            <button class="button" id="reviews-sync-btn">Sync Reviews Now</button>
          </div>
          <p class="gap-note">
            Pulls real reviews from each business's Google Place ID (max 5 per business — that's Google's own limit, not a choice made here). Set each business's Place ID in the table below — need to look one up? <a href="https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/places/web-service/place-id" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open the Place ID Finder →</a> Runs automatically every Monday, or trigger it manually.
